0..67 Comment "// Unbiased composition of a chain of paths at a certified stratum."
68..70 Comment "//"
71..145 Comment "// A chain of paths has one composite up to its bracketings, so the former"
146..196 Comment "// names that composite and chooses no bracketing."
197..199 Comment "//"
200..283 Comment "// `compose[n, k](chain(m), (c₁, …, cₘ))` composes `m` cells that meet end to"
284..362 Comment "// end. The chain sub-site certifies the stratum at degree `n` over bound `k`,"
363..447 Comment "// and the chain is a shape of it. The node carries the left-nested `Path.step` fold"
448..522 Comment "// of its cells. Evaluation runs the fold, and the kernel replays it as it"
523..569 Comment "// replays the chain written with `Path.step`."
570..572 Comment "//"
573..626 Comment "// - see: `then.gandr` — the composite of two paths"
627..709 Comment "// - see: `ledger/diagnostics/ComposeDoesNotFill.gandr` — cells that do not meet"
711..749 Comment "// The circle, its point and its loop."
750..756 Keyword "import"
757..758 StringLit "\""
758..777 StringLit "./circle-base.gandr"
777..778 StringLit "\""
778..779 Other ";"
